### FEEDBACK

### Create feedback - Manager gives feedback to volunteer (EVENT_MANAGER/ADMIN)
### Authorization: Bearer <event-manager access token>
### Event must be COMPLETED status
POST http://localhost:8000/events/6939bc11a51303dc97d03313/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..HchJDPL4b4uGRcPfIfArpbQBfrIWhfJYC2fQUZkm2XE

{
  "volunteerId": "693a61404d2ad28e43da4e42",
  "feedbackType": "manager_to_volunteer",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Tuyệt vời! Volunteer rất nhiệt tình và có trách nhiệm."
}

### Create feedback - Volunteer gives feedback about event (VOLUNTEER)
### Authorization: Bearer <volunteer access token>
### Event must be COMPLETED status
POST http://localhost:8000/events/6939bc11a51303dc97d03313/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..8dUHaClDLS73_18N-OkC3CyH64HFcs_ziB5QkBVDew4

{
  "volunteerId": "693a61404d2ad28e43da4e42",
  "feedbackType": "volunteer_to_event",
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Sự kiện rất ý nghĩa, tổ chức tốt nhưng có thể cải thiện về hậu cần."
}

### Get feedback for event (PUBLIC) - lấy tất cả feedback của một event
GET http://localhost:8000/events/6939bc11a51303dc97d03313/feedback?page=1&limit=10&feedbackType=manager_to_volunteer
Accept: application/json

### Get feedback for volunteer (AUTHENTICATED) - lấy feedback của một volunteer
### Authorization: Bearer <any authenticated user token>
GET http://localhost:8000/events/6939bc11a51303dc97d03313/feedback/volunteer/693a61404d2ad28e43da4e42?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..8dUHaClDLS73_18N-OkC3CyH64HFcs_ziB5QkBVDew4
Accept: application/json
